	(text "ESC POWER STAGE - one motor (36 V 10S, 30 A peak). DRV8323S + 6x CSD19532Q5B + 3x 1 mOhm shunts"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "38c7d58a-7b3a-5c0d-87af-13e7fc1bb385")
	)
	(text "Instanced twice: ESC_Motor_1 (refs 3xx) and ESC_Motor_2 (refs 4xx). Both are driven by the single STM32F405VGT6 on sheet ESC_MCU (VESC dual-motor, Stormcore 60D pin map)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 28 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "624032cd-b282-5bf4-8eeb-cde31a1d73aa")
	)
	(text "GATE DRIVER: DRV8323S (SPI, 6x PWM, 3 CSAs, gain set by firmware = 10 V/V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190 95 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "e99afa08-f74b-5d65-a0a3-930388503e6d")
	)
	(text "POWER STAGE: 3 half-bridges, CSD19532Q5B 100 V, 1 mOhm shunts (route SPx/GND as Kelvin pair to the DRV8323S)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 335 95 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "5f649a4d-53f4-5cbf-b812-e078839bc39f")
	)
	(text "SENSING: phase voltages (39k/2.2k), FET NTC (low side, 10k pull-up, B3435), motor NTC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 290 280 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "127c7d02-6e57-5652-8422-87abbbf382b4")
	)
	(text "MOTOR INTERFACE: halls (commutation) + motor NTC. Odometry encoders go to the ESP32 (J202/J203)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 400 322 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "882d0cba-accd-5a50-ac54-3a2074c37165")
	)
	(text "NOTES: (1) DRV8323S VM abs max 65 V, recommended 60 V: D301 SMCJ43A TVS on VBUS (one per stage): ~54 V at a few A, 69 V at full current, so it only trims regen spikes; the real limit is VESC max input voltage 46-48 V (regen stops before the breaker can strand the energy). (2) R310-R315 slew trim 2.2 R. (3) SDO is open drain: both DRVs share MISO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 405 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "e609917a-36d2-510f-8769-ac09e38e5242")
	)
	(text "VM: 100nF + 10uF within 3 mm of pin 4; CPH-CPL 47nF rated VM; VCP-VM 1uF/25V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195 100 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6e8e7222-fbc7-59ae-96c1-8203610111bf")
	)
	(text "FET NTC on the low side (VESC NTC_RES formula, beta 3434). Place NT301 next to the FETs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 290 318 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "5a86615a-1351-54e2-8c7b-d9333c725555")
	)
